my config

# sxmo backup
Restore: `./restore.sh` (copies files/ into $HOME, existing files -> *.orig).

Not included (do manually on the new device):
- ~/.ssh keys (secrets)
- /etc/doas.conf (root-only)
- ~/Developer/{WindEmu,qemu-jornada720} and ~/PumpkinOS, ~/roms — userscripts in
  ~/.config/sxmo/userscripts reference them via $HOME/...
- Packages: foot, wob, wofi, neovim, htop, git, qemu (install via apk)
- ~/.config/nvim is a git clone of: https://github.com/DmitriiTrifonov/nvim-config.git (backup holds a plain copy; `git clone` it instead if you prefer)
